# =============================================================
#  .gitignore — what travels between devices/platforms, and what doesn't
#
#  Rule of thumb:
#    - Content + layouts + config + assets  → TRACKED (the site's source of truth)
#    - Build output + tool caches + per-device state → IGNORED (derived or local)
#
#  Note: this controls SYNC (what Git shares across Obsidian, SilverBullet,
#  the GitHub web UI, and your machines). It is separate from Jekyll's
#  `exclude:` in _config.yml, which controls what gets PUBLISHED to the site.
# =============================================================

# --- Jekyll build output & caches (regenerated; never commit) ---
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
.sass-cache/

# --- Ruby / dependency lock (GitHub Pages resolves its own) ---
Gemfile.lock

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# =============================================================
#  Obsidian
#  Sync the SHARED vault config (so plugins/settings match across devices),
#  but NEVER sync per-device UI state — it conflicts constantly and means
#  nothing on other machines or on the server.
# =============================================================
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/workspace.mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/*.log

# If you'd rather keep the ENTIRE .obsidian folder private to each device
# (simplest, zero-conflict), comment out the five lines above and uncomment:
# .obsidian/

# --- Obsidian trash (the "delete to trash" feature writes here) ---
.trash/

# =============================================================
#  SilverBullet
#  SilverBullet keeps an index/database derived from your Markdown.
#  The .md files ARE the source of truth and sync; the index does not.
# =============================================================
.silverbullet.db
.silverbullet.db-*
_plug/
.sb-*

# =============================================================
#  Editor / misc local state
# =============================================================
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
